          "id": "d-1.1",
          "claim": "The vector $\\psi$ is a normalized Fourier/occupation basis vector: its link label is $n_e=0$, its site occupations are $n_{v_1}=1,n_{v_2}=0$, and these occupations lie in the finite fermion Fock basis.",
          "step": "1.1",
