          "id": "d-2.1",
          "claim": "At $v_1$, $\\gamma_{v_1}=n_e-(n_{v_1}-b_{v_1})=0-(1-1)=0$. At $v_2$, $\\gamma_{v_2}=-n_e-(n_{v_2}-b_{v_2})=0-(0-0)=0$. Thus every Gauss operator annihilates $\\psi$, so $\\psi\\in\\mathcal H_{\\rm phys}$ and the physical projection is nonzero.",
